@startuml C1_Create_Vessel_Visit_Execution_Process_View
title C1 – Create Vessel Visit Execution (Process View)

actor "Logistics Operator" as LogisticsOp
participant "VVEController\n(API Layer)" as Controller
participant "VVEMapper\n(Data Mapper)" as Mapper
participant "VVEService\n(Domain Logic)" as Service
participant "PortContext\n(EF Core)" as Context
database "Database\n(SQL / InMemory)" as DB


LogisticsOp -> Controller : POST /api/VesselVisitExecutions\n(CreateVVEDTO with VVN reference)
Controller -> Mapper : Converte DTO → Entidade de Domínio
Mapper --> Controller : Retorna objeto VesselVisitExecution

Controller -> Service : Valida VVN existente e cria VVE
Service -> Service : Gera identificador VVE\nDefine arrival time\nDefine creator user ID\nMarca como "In Progress"
Service --> Controller : VVE criado e validado

Controller -> Context : Adiciona entidade VesselVisitExecution
Context -> DB : Persiste dados (SaveChanges)
DB --> Context : Confirma inserção
Context --> Controller : OK

Controller --> LogisticsOp : HTTP 201 Created\n(VVEDTO com status "In Progress")


@enduml
